    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yelusalemu akupocela cilango",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko napikene Mlungu alimkuŵeceta mwakwesya kuti, “Myice akuno, jemanja ŵandu ŵamkwawula kukonanga msindawo. Jwalijose ajigale cida cakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwa kandaŵi kamo ŵayice acalume msano ni jumo ŵakutyocela kumpoto kwa Cipata ca Nyumba ja AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵaliwose ali ajigale cida. Pa likuga lyawolyo papali mundu jwine juŵawete nguwo ja bafuta, ŵajigele yindu yakuti alembele. Wosopewo ŵayice ni kwima pambali pa malo gakupelecela mbopesi ga bulonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko ucimbicimbi wa lilanguka lya Mlungu jwa Aisalaeli wawonecele kutyocela mwa mkelubi mula mwele muwaliji, ni kwawula pakwinjilila m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE. AMBUJE ŵamŵilasile mundu juŵawete yakuwala yabafuta jula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mjawule mu msinda wosope wa Yelusalemu ni mkaŵice cimanyisyo pawusyo pa ŵandu wosope ŵele ŵakulila ni kulagasika ligongo lyakusakalilwa ni yakusakala yikutendecekwa kweleko.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
